<title>THAILAND: Shinawatra Computer yr net falls.</title>
<headline>Shinawatra Computer yr net falls.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Consolidated financial results for year ending December 31 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				 Twelve months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		 18.99     vs	  23.78</p>
<p>    Net		     2,631.36     vs	3,295.93</p>
<p>NOTES: Revs not stated. Company's full name is Shinawatra Computer and Communications Plc, a communications business group.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-6520642</p>
</text>
